    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a role-playing maze exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes on the role of a white-collar worker named Aiko who is imprisoned in a maze by mysterious magic. Explore the intricate maze, avoid traps, collect key items, and gradually uncover the dark secrets behind the maze. Time is pressing. Behind every door, there might be hope or even deeper despair...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 A beautiful female lead</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Custom character costumes (stockings, high heels)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 A complex and intricate maze</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 A wide variety of mechanisms and props</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could you help her escape?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a role-playing maze exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes on the role of a white-collar worker named Aiko who is imprisoned in a maze by mysterious magic. Explore the intricate maze, avoid traps, collect key items, and gradually uncover the dark secrets behind the maze. Time is pressing. Behind every door, there might be hope or even deeper despair...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 A beautiful female lead</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Custom character costumes (stockings, high heels)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 A complex and intricate maze</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 A wide variety of mechanisms and props</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could you help her escape?</p>",
